OL,3,GNEWSAPM declines meeting with Stormont 
OL,4,Aministers over budget stalemate        
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister Andy Burnham has    
OL,7,Fturned down a request from Northern    
OL,8,FIreland's first and deputy first       
OL,9,Fministers for a meeting over Stormont's
OL,10,Fbudget stalemate.                      
OL,12,FMichelle O'Neill and Emma              
OL,13,FLittle-Pengelly jointly wrote to the   
OL,14,Fprime minister seeking the direct      
OL,15,Fengagement in a bid to resolve the     
OL,16,Fseven-month impasse.                   
OL,18,FBut it is understood the prime minister
OL,19,Fhas backed Northern Ireland Secretary  
OL,20,FSir Chris Bryant continuing to lead    
OL,21,Ftalks on behalf of the government.     
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
