OL,3,GNEWSAPM declines meeting with Stormont 
OL,4,Aministers over budget stalemate        
OL,6,FThe prime minister is said to be urging
OL,7,Fthe Stormont executive to accept the   
OL,8,Fgovernment's offer of an extra #1.5bn  
OL,9,Fover the next three years and finalise 
OL,10,Fa financial plan.                      
